{"seq":3,"slug":"animations-effects","title":"动画与视觉效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/modern/animations-effects","wordCount":1303,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画与视觉效果\">动画与视觉效果</h1><p>页面间切换时元素平滑地移动到新位置、滚动时进度条随滚轮填充、卡片悬停时柔和地浮起——这些曾经必须靠 JavaScript 监听事件、计算位置、操作 DOM 的交互，2026 年大多能用纯 CSS 声明完成。这一篇沿一条线讲透：从过渡与关键帧动画的基础，到同源视图过渡，再到滚动驱动与滚动触发动画，展示 CSS 如何把交互体验收进样式表，呼应整个现代特性章&quot;用原生能力替代旧妥协&quot;的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CSS 动画有两种基础形态：过渡（<code>transition</code>）在状态改变时插值两个值，关键帧动画（<code>@keyframes</code> + <code>animation</code>）定义多阶段的自主播放。在此之上，2025–2026 年成熟的高级能力把动画接到了新的&quot;驱动源&quot;：视图过渡（View Transitions）由 DOM 状态变化驱动，滚动驱动动画由滚动位置而非时间驱动。所有这些都受一个无障碍约束统辖——尊重 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[CSS 动画驱动源] --&gt; B[时间驱动]&#10;  A --&gt; C[状态驱动]&#10;  A --&gt; D[滚动驱动]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[transition 状态插值]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[animation + keyframes 自主播放]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[View Transitions 视图过渡&lt;br/&gt;同源 2025 Baseline]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[scroll-timeline 随滚动进度]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[view-timeline 随进入视口]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[滚动触发 Chrome 145]&#10;  A --&gt; E[无障碍约束&lt;br/&gt;prefers-reduced-motion]\">flowchart TD\n  A[CSS 动画驱动源] --&gt; B[时间驱动]\n  A --&gt; C[状态驱动]\n  A --&gt; D[滚动驱动]\n  B --&gt; B1[transition 状态插值]\n  B --&gt; B2[animation + keyframes 自主播放]\n  C --&gt; C1[View Transitions 视图过渡&lt;br/&gt;同源 2025 Baseline]\n  D --&gt; D1[scroll-timeline 随滚动进度]\n  D --&gt; D2[view-timeline 随进入视口]\n  D --&gt; D3[滚动触发 Chrome 145]\n  A --&gt; E[无障碍约束&lt;br/&gt;prefers-reduced-motion]</pre><p>下表对比四种动画手段的驱动源与典型场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>驱动源</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>2026 状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>transition</code></td>\n<td>状态切换（hover、类变化）</td>\n<td>按钮悬停、展开收起</td>\n<td>长期 Baseline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@keyframes</code>/<code>animation</code></td>\n<td>时间线自主播放</td>\n<td>加载动画、脉冲提示</td>\n<td>长期 Baseline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>View Transitions（同源）</td>\n<td>DOM 更新</td>\n<td>单页内视图切换</td>\n<td>2025 Baseline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动驱动动画</td>\n<td>滚动/视口进度</td>\n<td>进度条、视差、入场</td>\n<td>跟进中，触发版 Chrome 145</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"过渡与关键帧-性能友好的基础\">过渡与关键帧：性能友好的基础</h2><p><code>transition</code> 在某属性值改变时自动插值。要让动画流畅，关键是只动画 <code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 这两个属性——它们能交给合成器（compositor）在 GPU 上处理，不触发布局重排（reflow）。动画 <code>width</code>、<code>top</code>、<code>margin</code> 这类几何属性会逐帧重排，在低端设备上卡顿。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".btn {&#10;  transition:&#10;    transform 0.2s ease,&#10;    box-shadow 0.2s ease;&#10;}&#10;.btn:hover {&#10;  transform: translateY(-2px);&#10;  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.btn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    box-shadow </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.btn:hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  box-shadow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--shadow-md</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键帧动画用 <code>@keyframes</code> 定义多阶段，再用 <code>animation</code> 应用。缓动函数（timing function）决定节奏：<code>ease</code>、<code>ease-in-out</code> 适合大多数 UI，<code>linear</code> 适合进度类，<code>cubic-bezier()</code> 可自定义，<code>steps()</code> 做逐帧/打字机效果。这些动画用到的 <code>transform</code>、<code>translateY</code> 等值，其单位语义见<a href=\"../foundations/values-units-functions\">值、单位与函数</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes pulse {&#10;  from {&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;  }&#10;  50% {&#10;    opacity: 0.4;&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;.skeleton {&#10;  animation: pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pulse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  50%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.skeleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: pulse </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease-in-out</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> infinite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"视图过渡-由-dom-状态驱动\">视图过渡：由 DOM 状态驱动</h2><p>视图过渡（View Transitions API）让&quot;从旧界面到新界面&quot;的变化自动产生平滑过渡，浏览器对前后两个状态做快照并在它们之间插值。同源（同一文档内）视图过渡在 2025 年已成为 Baseline；跨文档（多页面间）过渡因为尚未在所有主流浏览器落地，2026 年还未 Baseline，但随 Interop 2026 在推进。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@view-transition {&#10;  navigation: auto;&#10;} /* 声明启用跨文档视图过渡 */&#10;.hero-image {&#10;  view-transition-name: hero;&#10;} /* 标记需在前后状态间过渡的元素 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@view-transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  navigation: auto;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 声明启用跨文档视图过渡 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.hero-image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  view-transition-name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: hero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 标记需在前后状态间过渡的元素 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>给元素一个唯一的 <code>view-transition-name</code>，浏览器就会在状态切换时让它从旧位置/尺寸平滑移动到新位置——典型如点击列表项后该项的图片&quot;放大&quot;成详情页大图。这把过去要手写 FLIP 动画（First-Last-Invert-Play）的复杂逻辑变成几行声明。它是 <a href=\"modern-selectors\"><code>:has()</code> 那类&quot;CSS 替代 JavaScript&quot;</a> 趋势在动画领域的延续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滚动驱动动画-把时间换成滚动\">滚动驱动动画：把时间换成滚动</h2><p>传统动画沿时间线播放，滚动驱动动画把时间线换成<strong>滚动进度</strong>——动画的推进由用户滚动多少决定，而非秒数。它用两类时间线：<code>scroll-timeline</code> 绑定某个滚动容器的滚动进度，<code>view-timeline</code> 绑定某元素进入/离开视口的进度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 阅读进度条：随页面滚动从 0 到 100% */&#10;@keyframes grow {&#10;  from {&#10;    transform: scaleX(0);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    transform: scaleX(1);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;.progress-bar {&#10;  transform-origin: left;&#10;  animation: grow linear;&#10;  animation-timeline: scroll(root block);&#10;}&#10;/* 元素进入视口时淡入上移 */&#10;@keyframes reveal {&#10;  from {&#10;    opacity: 0;&#10;    transform: translateY(2rem);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;    transform: none;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;.card {&#10;  animation: reveal linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: view();&#10;  animation-range: entry 0% cover 40%;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 阅读进度条：随页面滚动从 0 到 100% */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> grow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.progress-bar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform-origin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: grow </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scroll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">block</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 元素进入视口时淡入上移 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> reveal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: reveal </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cover</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这两段都不需要一行 JavaScript——过去阅读进度条要监听 <code>scroll</code> 事件、入场动画要用 IntersectionObserver。<code>timeline-scope</code> 还能让滚动时间线跨 DOM 分支共享。2026 年更进一步：Chrome 145 引入滚动触发动画（scroll-triggered），即&quot;滚过某个偏移就触发一段基于时间的动画&quot;，直接替代 IntersectionObserver 的常见用法。滚动驱动动画正随 Interop 2026 走向跨浏览器一致支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍-尊重减少动效偏好\">无障碍：尊重减少动效偏好</h2><p>动画做得再炫，也必须给前庭功能敏感的用户留出退路。<code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 媒体特性反映用户在系统里&quot;减少动态效果&quot;的设置，是无障碍的硬要求而非可选项——这与<a href=\"../layout/responsive-container\">响应式章</a>讲的用户偏好特性、<a href=\"../architecture/design-tokens-variables\">设计令牌章</a>讲的深色模式偏好是同一套机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {&#10;  *,&#10;  *::before,&#10;  *::after {&#10;    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;&#10;    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    scroll-behavior: auto !important;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-iteration-count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    scroll-behavior</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确做法不是&quot;有偏好就完全无动画&quot;，而是把大幅位移、缩放、视差等可能引发不适的动效降级或关闭，保留必要的状态反馈（如焦点提示）。把这条媒体查询作为全站兜底、再对关键动效单独精细处理，是 2026 年负责任的动画实践底线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>动画基础是过渡（状态插值）与关键帧（时间线自主播放）；为流畅只动画 <code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code>，避免触发重排的几何属性。</li>\n<li>视图过渡由 DOM 状态变化驱动，用 <code>view-transition-name</code> 标记元素即可自动插值；同源 2025 已 Baseline，跨文档随 Interop 2026 推进。</li>\n<li>滚动驱动动画把时间线换成滚动进度，用 <code>scroll-timeline</code>/<code>view-timeline</code> 实现进度条、入场动画而无需 JS；Chrome 145 的滚动触发动画替代 IntersectionObserver。</li>\n<li>所有动画必须尊重 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>，把大幅动效降级而非简单全关，这是无障碍硬要求。</li>\n<li>这一篇延续现代特性章主题：视图过渡、滚动动画、<code>:has()</code> 共同把曾经依赖 JavaScript 的交互收回纯 CSS。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画与视觉效果","id":"动画与视觉效果"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡与关键帧：性能友好的基础","id":"过渡与关键帧-性能友好的基础"},{"level":2,"text":"视图过渡：由 DOM 状态驱动","id":"视图过渡-由-dom-状态驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动驱动动画：把时间换成滚动","id":"滚动驱动动画-把时间换成滚动"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍：尊重减少动效偏好","id":"无障碍-尊重减少动效偏好"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现代选择器与嵌套","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/modern/modern-selectors"},"next":null}